WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Original electronic instrumental music]
Make room for the work.
Your agents. Your tools. One workspace.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Every thread. In its place.
A workspace with room for everything you’re building.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose your point of view.
Bring the coding providers you already use.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Stay close to the code.
Real commands. Split terminals. Results in view.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
From an idea. To something you can open.
Keep the result beside the conversation that shaped it.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
A team shaped by you.
Give each agent a purpose and a way of working.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Start with a thought.
Your orchestrator keeps the workspace within reach.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
The context stays with the work.
Projects, conversations, and the next step. Together.

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Build something that matters.
$10 / month     or     $120 / year
